@add Diggy_Trust 4
@add Parent_Trust 2
Diggy: Together. Yeah. I like that.
*v_done
@bg diner_night
He takes her to the same 24-hour diner from the fundraiser. He carries her in from the car because of the ankle. The waitress remembers them.
Diggy: Pancakes. Two. And whatever she says about it, she wants extra syrup.
London: I do not.
London: (thirty seconds later) ...Extra syrup.
There was a time, at fourteen, fifteen, when a midnight diner would've been the hardest place in the world. Tonight it's just pancakes, and a boy who makes her laugh with his mouth full.
